    {
      "id": "e8eca25c-195a-46bd-8e4f-b5dd109d8ddf",
      "name": "Sticky Note 360775cc",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1152,
        608
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Edvora fee reminders — inactive until integration\nDaily 09:00 Africa/Lagos; claims at most 10 jobs. Backend /api/automation/reminders/{claim,authorize,outcome} owns the due queue and committed records. Claims use 15-minute leases; authorization consumes one claim and creates a single attempt with a fresh 3-minute send window.\nRecheck current term, due window, active pupil/guardian, fee pause, authorized guardian, channel consent/private chat and positive authoritative balance. Zero balance stops reminders. Each rule/child/guardian/channel is queued once for this term.\nEvery outcome includes job_id, claim_token, attempt_id, attempt_token. A denied send with no attempt is an acknowledgement only. SMS accepted is not delivered; Telegram sent is not read. Unknown/timeouts require review. HTTP 429 can use bounded backend backoff; providers are never automatically retried here. Outcome HTTP writes may retry idempotently.\nConfigure deployed HTTPS origin, approved Termii sender/account send URL, Edvora Backend Service and dedicated provider credentials. SMS and Telegram only; no linking flow. No messages sent during this update.",
        "color": 5
      }
    }
